# Git Push Proxy

When pushing this repository to GitHub, route the command through the working proxy:

```bash
HTTP_PROXY=http://10.144.1.10:8080 HTTPS_PROXY=http://10.144.1.10:8080 git push origin <branch>
```

Do not store GitHub tokens in commands, files, remote URLs, or Git configuration.
